REMARK   3 FITTING PROCEDURE : AN INITIAL MODEL WAS GENERATED BASED ON THE      
REMARK   3  KNOWN CRYSTAL STRUCTURE OF THE ECTO-DOMAIN (PDB:1SVB), DENGUE       
REMARK   3  VIRUS TYPE 2 AND THE ZIKA VIRUS (PDB:5IRE,3J27) USING THE           
REMARK   3  PROGRAM MODELLER. THE MODEL WAS RIGID-BODY FITTED TO THE            
REMARK   3  ELECTRON DENSITY MAP OF THE TBEV PARTICLE USING THE PROGRAM         
REMARK   3  CHIMERA. SUBSEQUENTLY, THE STRUCTURE WAS MANUALLY CORRECTED         
REMARK   3  USING THE PROGRAM COOT, FOLLOWED BY REAL-SPACE REFINEMENT IN        
REMARK   3  PHENIX AND RECIPROCAL SPACE REFINEMENT IN REFMAC5.                  
